WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:07.272
Here come the blobs.

2
00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:10.168
What do they see?

3
00:00:10.169 --> 00:00:12.201
They see a map.

4
00:00:12.202 --> 00:00:17.260
It's a treasure map!

5
00:00:17.261 --> 00:00:30.973
The blobs look at the map.

6
00:00:30.974 --> 00:00:37.029
They go across a beach.

7
00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:50.152
They go into a jungle.

8
00:00:50.153 --> 00:01:04.350
They go across a river.

9
00:01:04.351 --> 00:01:41.270
They go into a cave.

10
00:01:41.271 --> 00:02:11.437
They go across a bridge.

11
00:02:11.438 --> 00:02:28.150
Wow! The blobs found the treasure.

12
00:02:28.151 --> 00:02:39.244
Look out, blobs!

13
00:02:39.245 --> 00:02:43.395
There's a trap! Uh-oh.

14
00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:46.138
Silly blobs!

15
00:02:46.139 --> 00:02:49.346
Good-bye!

